+``ObjectReferenceSegment.iter_raw_references()`` in ``dialect_ansi``, with
+overrides in ``dialect_bigquery``), which coupled rule logic to the dialect
+class hierarchy. It's now exposed here as free functions which take the name
+of the dialect and select the appropriate behaviour from it. The segment
+methods remain as deprecated wrappers around these functions.
+"""
+
+import warnings
+from collections.abc import Generator, Sequence
+from enum import Enum
